        "text": "3/4",
        "rationale": "Correct."
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "25/20",
        "rationale": "That is sec θ, the reciprocal of cos θ."
      }
    ],
    "correct_choice": "C",
    "explanation": "sin θ = √(1 − (20/25)²) = 15/25; tan θ = sin θ/cos θ = (15/25)/(20/25) = 15/20 = 3/4.",
